  clock 65/41: compositions C(K-1,L-1) = 250649105469666120, necklaces (rotation classes) = 6113392816333320
q is rotation-invariant (signed_cycles sec.3, PROVED), so the gate is a test per necklace;
on 11/7 the seven-cycle is one necklace of the 30, its 7 rotations the 7 q=1 words of pillai S5.
  q=1 words on 11/7: 7

==============================================================================
S10. D_L = K_L - L log_2 3 and the budget sum q_L on the known cycles (both sheets)
==============================================================================
Identity (glued_xor sec.3, PROVED): n_L q_L = n_0 + (b/3) sum_{i<L} q_i, q_i = 2^(K_i)/3^i.
b=+1 (1,): D per period = +0.415037 (-> +inf linearly), ratio 2^K/3^L = 4/3 > 1, sum q_i DIVERGES; n_L q_L = n_0 + (1/3) sum q_i grows.
b=-1 (1,): D per period = K - L log_2 3 = -0.584963 (-> -inf linearly), sum q_i over one period = 1, geometric ratio 2^K/3^L = 2/3, total sum q = 3 = 3 n_0 = 3
b=-1 (5, 7): D per period = K - L log_2 3 = -0.169925 (-> -inf linearly), sum q_i over one period = 5/3, geometric ratio 2^K/3^L = 8/9, total sum q = 15 = 3 n_0 = 15
b=-1 (17, 25, 37, 55, 41, 61, 91): D per period = K - L log_2 3 = -0.094738 (-> -inf linearly), sum q_i over one period = 2363/729, geometric ratio 2^K/3^L = 2048/2187, total sum q = 51 = 3 n_0 = 51
Verdict: on the plus sheet D_L -> -infinity and sum q_L < infinity are NECESSARY for a divergent
orbit and are VIOLATED by every cycle (D_L -> +infinity), so they separate cycle from escape.
On the minus sheet EVERY orbit, periodic or not, has D_L -> -infinity and sum q_L <= 3 n_0
(positivity alone); the discriminator there is budget exhaustion: sum q_L = 3 n_0 iff eventually
periodic.  The condition 'D_L -> -infinity' is SHEET-BLIND as a necessary condition on a
divergent orbit, SIGN-SPECIFIC as a cycle/escape discriminator.
No bounded strip (guards 2a, PROVED on the plus sheet by source density): on the minus sheet
a strip A <= q_j <= B gives n_j = (n_0 - sum/3)/q_j <= n_0/A, a bounded hence eventually periodic
orbit, whose D_L -> -infinity (sign law: 2^K < 3^L) contradicts q_j >= A.  SHEET-BLIND
conclusion, different proofs (density on +, positivity on -; cf. g_negatives S9/S10 for G).
  q_(7m) along the seven-cycle, m=1..10: 0.9364 0.8769 0.8212 0.7690 0.7201 0.6744 0.6315 0.5914 0.5538 0.5186

